<title>GERMANY: PWA 96 pretax profit 261 mln dmk vs 161 mln.</title>
<headline>PWA 96 pretax profit 261 mln dmk vs 161 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ASCHAFFENBURG, Germany 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     261     vs 161</p>
<p>    Dividend (planned)			 7	 vs 7 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German paper manufacturing group is PWA Papierwerke AG. The company said sales in 1996 were approximately unchanged at about five billion marks.</p>
<p>It also said that the pre-tax profit for 1996 contained extraordinary income of 110 million marks resulting from the sale of subsidiaries PWA Dekor and PWA Kunststoff as well as from other measures.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
